envelope: 1
uuid: nexus-export-schema-file_delta
type: schema
id: file_delta
context: >-
  versionium/schemas — registered 2026-09-15 per MCO-A
  (idearium-repository-overhaul-phasemap.spec). Home confirmed versionium/
  (not cortex/) — see docs/2026-09-15-versionium-cortex-snapshot-migration-
  decision.md, D1. Deliberately separate from cortex's schema.sigma_record
  — that table is a live, 707-row component-divergence-score store for a
  different concept; this is a per-file diff record for the
  versionium<->idearium bridge (MCO-B).
intent: null
summary: null
system: versionium
tags: []
exported_at: 1789564800000
source: idearium-repository-overhaul-phasemap.spec:MCO-A
payload:
  status: REAL
  source: >-
    MCO-B (2026-09-20): versionium/lib/files.js is now the real writer, and
    writes and reads back real rows in tests/modules/test-mcob-file-
    versioning.js. Status moved OPEN -> REAL on that proof. Original MCO-A
    note follows. Registered this pass. No real writer exists yet — will be written by
    versionium.file.delta.capability once MCO-B lands (this spec's own
    gate: MET when both schemas are indexed AND one real round-trip row
    passes each; the round-trip below proves the shape, not a production
    writer — see tests/modules/test-mco-a-schemas.js MCOA-002). Marked
    OPEN, not REAL, per §1.1 (nothing exists until proven) — matches this
    codebase's actual status vocabulary (REAL/OPEN), not the draft's own
    invented PROPOSED (docs/2026-09-15-versionium-cortex-snapshot-
    migration-decision.md, D7).
  fields:
    uuid:
      type: string
      required: true
      description: real delta record id
    file_path:
      type: string
      required: true
      description: repo-relative path of the file this delta applies to
    commit_ref:
      type: string
      required: true
      description: "references versionium_commit.uuid — the commit this delta belongs to"
    diff:
      type: string
      required: true
      description: unified diff against the previous snapshot/delta chain for this file
    bytes_saved:
      type: number
      required: false
      description: byte-count delta vs storing a full snapshot, for observability only
    repository:
      type: string
      required: false
      description: "MCO-B — the repository (idearium repo uuid) this delta belongs to; the chain is per repository + path"
    base_sha256:
      type: string
      required: false
      description: "MCO-B — sha256 of the bytes this diff applies to; checked before applying"
    result_sha256:
      type: string
      required: false
      description: "MCO-B — sha256 the diff must reproduce; checked after applying, and verified again at write time"
    result_bytes:
      type: number
      required: false
      description: "MCO-B — byte length of the reproduced file"
    ts:
      type: number
      required: true
      description: real delta timestamp
